tmp-*
**/tmp-*

# The dev server's build cache. Vercel builds from source on its own builders,
# so this is never needed in an upload — and including it is actively harmful:
# the deploy walks and uploads .next at the same moment the local dev server is
# writing to it, which on Windows fails with "UNKNOWN: unknown error, open
# .next\static\chunks\app\layout.js" and leaves the cache corrupt. That is what
# has been making the dev server serve unstyled HTML with no hydration after a
# deploy; the fix is to stop shipping the directory, not to keep deleting it.
.next

# ── Work in progress: never ships until the owner says so ───────────────────
# The Sufra restaurant template is still under test. These paths stay in the
# repo and run on the local dev server (/demo/sufra), but are excluded from
# every deploy. Nothing outside these folders imports them, so the production
# build is unaffected. Remove these lines only when the owner approves shipping.
app/demo/sufra
components/theme/sufra
utils/sufra
